    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Gnostic</strong></p><p><strong>“The archons have no leverage left.”</strong></p><p>At this level, misinformation simply fails around you. False peace offers unravel. Illusions collapse under scrutiny. The system cannot trick what no longer participates in its symbolic shortcuts.</p><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>When pursuing the <strong>Spark of Truth (Tiferet)</strong>, enemy factions cannot gain bonuses from Stealth, misinformation, or false alliances</li></ul><p>The Great Work recognizes clarity. So do the things that depended on confusion.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> when truth reaches this level of force, it breaks camouflage for everyone nearby. Expect retaliation, exposed conflict lines, and enemies who prefer open hostility to further revelation.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
